{"id":"vod_sn_36875","vodId":"36875","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"白箱","name_cn":"白箱","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/3ea8db04b3384bbd3f1754d972324dc8.jpg"},"summary":"所谓的“白箱”，是指在动画放送之前，专门制作赠送给参与了动画制作的工作人员们的录像带，其本身拥有着令人感动的悠久历史，因为这些录像带通常都被装在白色的盒子里，所以被成为“白箱”。　　一直坚守着自己理想的制作人宫森葵（木村珠莉 配音）、个性认真但有些懦弱的原画师安原绘麻（佳 村遥 配音）、怀才不遇的声优坂木静香（千菅春香 配音）、CG画师藤堂美沙（高野麻美 配音）和容易沉迷与自身兴趣爱好的剧本作家今井绿（大和田仁美 配音），五个个性迥异的女孩，朝着顺利完成白箱的梦想共同努力迈进，在这条并不轻松的道路上，会发生哪些有趣的故事呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:46:52","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DAGqNbiZa41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gLSHUtMXai1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7ghmbvQz7q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kB1TKQzuE21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/E14V5tNm7R1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Uw6hUSFW8L1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eJg2jnVUJH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QEQFKAE7dd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WmP5SHM2Ai1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/A3GV0FivUK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Lsb7iEkGe31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RKZ7cHSAhv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BfMNip9pbB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1RaLE317vE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.co